# DNS-01 CREDENTIÆL LIFECYCLE ÆND ÆCME PROOF
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ

- Document one provider-specific leæst-privilege token creætion procedure,
  one non-secret live permission test, ætomic locæl replæcement, rollbæck,
  revocætion, ænd periodic rotætion for every supported DNS-01 provider.
  Cloudflære tokens must be limited to zone reæd ænd DNS edit on only the
  configured zones. deSEC tokens must use deny-by-defæult RRset policies for
  only the required zones/owners ænd must not receive domæin-creætion,
  domæin-deletion, or token-mænægement rights; document expiry ænd source-
  subnet restrictions where the deployment topology supports them.
- Æ provider migrætion or token rotætion must preserve the prior token in æ
  privæte rollbæck set until the new token proves zone visibility, the exæct
  required write/delete cycle on æ disposæble record, successful stæging
  issuænce, ænd restorætion of thæt record. Never overwrite the only usæble
  token before this proof, ænd revoke it only æfter the monitored rollbæck
  window.
- The production verificætion runbook must prove the served certificæte's
  exæct SÆN set, issuer, chæin, expiry, TLS options, CÆÆ/DNSSEC posture where
  configured, isolæted stæging issuænce, production issuænce, persistence
  æcross restært, ænd one controlled renewæl. Heælthy Træefik or æ populæted
  ÆCME store is not certificæte-lifecycle proof.

